      "updated": 1793374982147,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here D,M,K and C are nodes and lines connecting\nthem are edges .\n\nReal world usage of GRAPHS\n--------------------------------------\n\n1. Social network - People connected as friends\non any social media .\n\n2. Maps - Cites connected with road/flight and\ntrains .\n\n3. Dependencies - Tasks or packages that\ndepend on each other .\n\n4. Internet - Computer on internet are actually\nconnected by network .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here D,M,K and C are nodes and lines connecting them are edges .\n\nReal world usage of GRAPHS\n--------------------------------------\n\n1. Social network - People connected as friends on any social media .\n\n2. Maps - Cites connected with road/flight and trains .\n\n3. Dependencies - Tasks or packages that depend on each other .\n\n4. Internet - Computer on internet are actually connected by network .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
